+    "4 = 1125 answers to 2F xx; 8 = GetFwType type 1; 1128: 0x10 = SET_CONFIG A0xx kept as GET values (EEPROM mirror), "
+    "0x20 = 1127 GET_CONFIG answer (each id one zero byte)");
